"lesson-en1/d0.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Hi, I'm Jun. Nice to meet you.",
"lesson-en1/d1.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|Nice to meet you too. I'm Emma. Where are you from?",
"lesson-en1/d2.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|I'm from Korea. I live in Seoul. How about you?",
"lesson-en1/d3.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|I'm from Canada. What do you do?",
"lesson-en1/d4.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|I'm a student. In my free time, I like watching anime.",
"lesson-en1/d5.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|Oh, me too! What's your favorite anime?",
"lesson-en1/d6.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Sorry, could you say that again?",
"lesson-en1/d7.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|What's your favorite anime?",
"lesson-en1/d8.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Oh! I like Ghibli movies.",
"lesson-en1/d9.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|Nice! See you next time!",
"lesson-en2/d0.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|What do you do on weekends?",
"lesson-en2/d1.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|I usually play games. Sometimes I watch movies.",
"lesson-en2/d2.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|What kind of games?",
"lesson-en2/d3.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Mostly RPGs. How about you?",
"lesson-en2/d4.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|I like listening to music. I go to concerts sometimes.",
"lesson-en2/d5.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Cool. Who's your favorite singer?",
"lesson-en2/d6.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|I really like Taylor Swift.",
"lesson-en2/d7.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Nice. Do you play any instruments?",
"lesson-en2/d8.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|No, but I want to learn the guitar.",
"lesson-en2/d9.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|That sounds fun!",
"lesson-en3/d0.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|Are you free this Saturday?",
"lesson-en3/d1.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Yes, I am. Why?",
"lesson-en3/d2.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|Do you want to see a movie?",
"lesson-en3/d3.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Sure! What time?",
"lesson-en3/d4.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|It starts at seven. Let's meet at six thirty in front of the station.",
"lesson-en3/d5.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Six thirty. Got it.",
"lesson-en3/d6.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|The ticket is fifteen dollars.",
"lesson-en3/d7.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|OK. See you on Saturday!",
"lesson-en4/d0.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|Hi, what can I get for you?",
"lesson-en4/d1.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Can I get an iced latte, please?",
"lesson-en4/d2.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|Sure. What size?",
"lesson-en4/d3.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Medium, please.",
"lesson-en4/d4.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|For here or to go?",
"lesson-en4/d5.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|To go, please. And can I get a blueberry muffin too?",
"lesson-en4/d6.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|Of course. That'll be eight fifty.",
"lesson-en4/d7.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Can I pay by card?",
"lesson-en4/d8.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|Yes. Can I get a name for the order?",
"lesson-en4/d9.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|It's Sam. Thanks!",
"lesson-en5/d0.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Excuse me, how much is this sweater?",
"lesson-en5/d1.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|It's forty dollars.",
"lesson-en5/d2.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Hmm, that's a little expensive. Do you have anything cheaper?",
"lesson-en5/d3.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|How about this one? It's twenty-five dollars.",
"lesson-en5/d4.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Nice. Do you have it in blue?",
"lesson-en5/d5.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|Yes, we have it in blue and black.",
"lesson-en5/d6.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|Can I try it on?",
"lesson-en5/d7.mp3": "Samantha (Enhanced)|None|Sure, the fitting room is over there.",
"lesson-en5/d8.mp3": "Evan (Enhanced)|None|It fits well. I'll take it.",
"lesson-ja1/d0.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|こんにちは。はじめまして。田中です。",
"lesson-ja1/d1.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|はじめまして。キムです。韓国から来ました。",
"lesson-ja1/d2.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|そうですか。学生ですか。",
"lesson-ja1/d3.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|はい、学生です。田中さんは?",
"lesson-ja1/d4.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|私は会社員です。",
"lesson-ja1/d5.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|私は漫画が好きです。田中さんは?",
"lesson-ja1/d6.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|私は映画が好きです。",
"lesson-ja1/d7.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|よろしくお願いします。",
"lesson-ja1/d8.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|よろしくお願いします。",
"lesson-ja2/d0.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|キムさん、あした、時間ありますか。",
"lesson-ja2/d1.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|はい、ありますよ。",
"lesson-ja2/d2.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|じゃあ、映画を見ませんか。",
"lesson-ja2/d3.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|いいですね。何時からですか。",
"lesson-ja2/d4.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|七時からです。六時半に駅で会いましょう。",
"lesson-ja2/d5.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|六時半ですね。わかりました。",
"lesson-ja2/d6.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|チケットは千五百円です。",
"lesson-ja2/d7.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|はい。じゃあ、またあした。",
"lesson-ja3/d0.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|いらっしゃいませ。ご注文は?",
"lesson-ja3/d1.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|コーヒーを一つください。",
"lesson-ja3/d2.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|ホットとアイス、どちらにしますか。",
"lesson-ja3/d3.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|アイスでお願いします。あと、このケーキも。",
"lesson-ja3/d4.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|店内ですか、お持ち帰りですか。",
"lesson-ja3/d5.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|店内で。",
"lesson-ja3/d6.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|千二百円です。",
"lesson-ja3/d7.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|カードでいいですか。",
"lesson-ja3/d8.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|はい、大丈夫です。",
"lesson-ja4/d0.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|すみません、これはいくらですか。",
"lesson-ja4/d1.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|三千円です。",
"lesson-ja4/d2.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|ちょっと高いですね。もう少し安いのはありますか。",
"lesson-ja4/d3.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|こちらはどうですか。二千円です。",
"lesson-ja4/d4.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|いいですね。色はほかにありますか。",
"lesson-ja4/d5.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|赤と青があります。",
"lesson-ja4/d6.mp3": "Otoya (Enhanced)|None|じゃあ、青をください。プレゼント用に包んでもらえますか。",
"lesson-ja4/d7.mp3": "Kyoko (Enhanced)|None|はい、かしこまりました。"
}